 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. FIBONACCI.

*> Print the first 15 Fibonacci numbers using PERFORM UNTIL.

 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 A        PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
 01 B        PIC 9(3) VALUE 1.
 01 NEXT-FIB PIC 9(3).
 01 I        PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.

 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN.
     PERFORM PRINT-NEXT UNTIL I > 14.
     STOP RUN.

 PRINT-NEXT.
     DISPLAY A.
     COMPUTE NEXT-FIB = A + B.
     MOVE B TO A.
     MOVE NEXT-FIB TO B.
     ADD 1 TO I.
